#b#cff0099ff* How to earn#nb#nc
 - Points: kills in the siege give points (+2 per kill, plus the bonuses on the Winning board). Points rank the Players and class boards.
 - MVP: the player with the most points in a siege is its MVP. MVP awards rank the MVP board.
 - Wins: the guild with the most points wins the siege. Wins rank the Guild board.